<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Joshua</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Toupa sikha Mosi sih nung in Mosi nasempa Nun tapa Joshua kiang ah Toupa’n
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka sikha Mosi a sita a; thou inla, nang leh hiai mipi tengteng in Jordan lui kan unla, Israel suante ka piak gam ah pai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi kiang a ka gensa bang in na khepek ua na sikna peuhmah uh k’on pevek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamdai apan leh hiai Lebanon tang apan lui lianpi Euphrates luipha a, Hitte gam tengteng, nitumna lam a tuipi zatak pha in na gam uh ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na damsung teng kuamah himhim in a hon nangzou kei ding. Mosi kiang a ka om bang in, nang kiang ah leng ka om ding hi. K’on zuausan kei dia, pai leng k’on paisan sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hattak leh hangsantak in om in. A suante uh kichiam a piak ka na chiamsa gam, hiaite luahsak ding na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sikha Mosi in dan tengteng zui dia thu a honpiak zui chinten din hattak leh hangsantak in om peuhmah phot in. Na paina teng a na lamzan zel theihna ding in na taklam ah hiam, na veilam ah hiam pialsan het ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai danbu in na kam pawtsan hetkei hen. Hiai a thu kigelh tengteng na zuih chinten theihna ding in sun leh zan in na ngaihtuah zaw ding ahi. Huchi in na lampite na tuahpha sakdia, na hong lamzang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu ka honpia hilou hiam? Hattak leh hangsantak in om in. Lau kenla, lunglel sam ken, Toupa na Pathian na paina teng ah na kiang a om ding hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in mipi heutute thu a pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Giahphual vasik unla, mipite kiang ah, ‘Nekding sutuah dih ua, Tu apan ni thum in Toupa na Pathian un gamluah dia a honpiak luahdin Jordan lui na kan ding uh ahi’ ” chi in, thu a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reubente, Gadte leh Manasseh nam kim khatte kiang ah Joshua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“ Toupa na Pathian un khawlna a honpia a, hiai a honpe ding chi a Toupa sikha Mosi in thu a honpiak theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na zite uh, na ta neu chikchikte leh na ganhonte uh zaw Jordan lui gal a Mosi in gam a hon na piak ah a om ding uh. Nou mi hat leh hangsan teng kigalvansa in na pai masa ding ua, na unaute uh na panpih ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n na unaute uh noute bangmah a khawlna a piak a, Toupa na Pathian un a hon gam piak amaute’n leng a luah mateng uh. Huchi in Toupa sikha Mosi in Jordan luigal, ni suahna lam gam nou a tuam dia a hon na piak na lam ah na kiknawn ding ua, na luah ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau, “Hihdia n’on thupiak tengteng ka hih ding uh, N’on sawlna teng ah leng ka pai ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banglam peuh a Mosi thu ka zuih bang un, nang thu leng ka zui ding uh. Toupa na Pathian Mosi kiang a a om bang in nang kiang ah leng om peuhmah phot hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuapeuh na thupiak kalh a, hel a, thu na piak peuhmah zui nuamlou zaw hihlup ding ahi. Hattak leh hangsantak in om peuhmah phot in” chi in Joshua a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan Nun tapa Joshua in, “A gam leh Jeriko khua va en mahdih ua” chi in mi nih Sittim apan a sim a enkhe ding a sawl hi. A va hoh ua, kizuak khat, a min Rahab inn ah a valut ua, huai ah a va zintung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai in, tu zan in gam enkhe din Israel suante a hong uh” chi in Jeriko kumpipa hilh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeriko khaw kumpipa’n, “Na inn a hongtung mikhualte hon pekhia in. Gam pumpi enkhe dia hong ahi uh” chi din Rahab kiang ah mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Numei in huai mi nihte a pi a, a sel a, a kiang uah, “He, mite ka kiang ah a hong ngei ngut ua, himahleh koi apan hongpai ahi ua, chih zaw ka theikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, khomial, kulh kongpi khak hunlai in huai mite a pawtkhe nawnta uh. Koi lam ah ahia a pai uh ka theita kei hi. Delh meng le uchin, na phalai ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh in tung ah a pitou a, in tung a jija kung siatkhawm lak a selkhin lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mite’n Jordan lui lam ah, a galkaina tan in a vadelh ua; a delhmite a pawt khiak tak un kulh kongpi a khak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lup ma un in tung ah a kiang uah a va hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Hiai gam Toupa’n nou a hon peta, na lauhhuaina un a hon delhkhum a, hiai gam a teng tengteng na ma uah a zulkhin uh, chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan na hongpawt khiak un Toupa’n Tuipi San a honhih kangsak a, Jordan luigal a Amorte kumpi nih: Sihon leh Og tung a na hih dante uh, huchibang a na hihmang dante uh lah ka na zata ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ka na zak tak un, ka lungtangte uh a zulkhin a, noute ziak a laulou himhim a omkei hi. Toupa na Pathian u lah tunglam van ah leh nuailam lei ah Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin na tung uah ka hehpihna ka langsakta hi, nou leng ka pa inkawte tung ah na hehpihna uh langsak sam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa, ka sanggam pasalte, ka sanggam numeite leh a neih teng uh hawi unla, sihna lak apan ka hinna uh hon hum bitsak din Toupa min in hehpih in ka kiang ah kichiam unla, chiamtehna dik honpia un,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite’n a kiang ah, “Ka thilhih uh na genkhiak kei ding leh na sih tang in ka si ding uh. Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n gam a honpiak hun chiang in, k’on hehpih ding ua, na tung ah muanhuaitak in ka hih ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tohlet ah khauhual a zan khesuk a; a inn khopi kulh khou a om ahi a, kulh tung a teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Tanglam zuan in pai un, huchilou in zaw nou hon delhte’n a honmu kha ding uh. Huai ah ni thum va kibu un; nou hon delhte a hong kiknawn masiah uh. Huai zoh chiang in na pai nawn na ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite’n a kiang ah, “Kichiamna a n’on kichiamsakna ah zaw dembei ka hi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai in, hiai gam ka honglut chiang un hiai khausan n’on khiakna tohlet ah na gak belh in. inn sung ah na kiang ah na pa, na nu, na sanggam teng leh na pa inkawte tengteng pilut vek in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, na inn kongpi apan kholak a pawtkhe peuhmah a lu tung ah a sisan a om dia, kou ahihleh mawh in ka omkei ding uh. Kuapeuh insung a na kiang a om peuhmah a tung ua khutkhak ahihleh, ka lu tung uah a sisan uh a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh ka thilhih uh na genkhiak leh n’on kichiamsakna ah mawh in ka omkei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman, “Na thu bangzel uh hileh ake” a chi a; huchi in amau a khakhia a, a paita uhi. Tohlet ah khau san a gakden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pai ua, huai tang a va tung ua, huai ah ni thum, amau delhte a kiknawn masiah uh a va om uhi. A delh mite’n lamtawn in a zong ua, himahleh a mu zoukei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai mi nihte a kiknawn ua, huai tang apan a paisuk ua, a galkah ua, Nun tapa Joshua kiang a tung ua; a tung ua thiltung tengteng a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joshua kiang ah, “ Toupa’n a gam pumpi i khut uah a hon na pe petmah ve, huai kia leng hilou, huai gam a tengte i ma uah a zulkhin uh,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Joshua zingkhang in a thou a, Israel suan tengteng toh Shittim apan a kisuan ua, Jordan lui a tung uhi. A galkah ma un huai ah a giak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, ni thum nung in heutute’n giahphual a vatawn vialvial uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Toupa na Pathian uh thukhun bawm leh siampute, Levi chite’n a zawn uh na muh chiang un na omna ua kipan kisuan unla, na zui ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh nou toh a kal tehna tong sang nih vel ahi ding ahi. Naih kei unla, huchi in na paina ding lampi na theithei ding uhi. Hiai lampi lah tuma lam in na tawn ngei ngalkei ua” chi in mipite thu a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joshua in mipite kiang ah, “Kihih siangthou un, zingchiang a Toupa’n na lak ua thillamdang mahmah hih ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in siampute kiang ah, “Thukhun bawm zawng unla, mipite ma ah galkah un” a chi hi. Huchi in thukhun bawm a zawng ua, mipite ma ah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Mosi kiang a ka om bang in na kiang ah ka om ding, chih a theihtheihna ding un, tuni in Israel tengteng mitmuh in k’on pahtawi pan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thukhun bawm zawng siampute, Jordan luigei na tun chiang un, Jordan lui ah dingden un, chi in thu pia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joshua in Israel suante kiang ah, “Hongpai unla, Toupa na Pathian uh thu hong ngaikhia un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in, “Hiai ah Pathian hing na lak uah a om a, na ma uah Kanante, Hitte, Hivte, Perizte, Girgaste, Amorte leh Jebuste a delhkhe ngeingei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai un, lei pumpi Toupa thukhun bawm in na ma uah Jordan lui a kan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel namte lak a mi sawmlehnih, namchih sik in mi khat zel telkhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa lei pumpi Toupa bawm zawng siampute khepek Jordan tui a a kingaktakin, Jordan tui, saklam apan tui hongluangte a kitat dia; a hong kiching venvon ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, mipite Jordan lui kan dia a puanin ua kipan a pawtlai un, thukhun bawm zawng siampute mipite ma ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawm zawngte Jordan lui a va tung ua, bawm zawng siampute khe in tuigei a siktakin, buhlak sung teng Jordan lui a kuang tengteng ah tui a let gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saklam apan tuipi luanglai a khawlta a, gamla kuamtak a Zarethan gam chin a Adam khua ah a hong kiching hi. Arabah tuipi, chi tuipi lam a luangsuk lai a kitat geih a; huchi in mipite Jeriko khozawn tak ah a galkahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa thukhun bawm zawng siampute Jordan luilai ah, leihul ah ading ua, mipi tengteng Jordan lui a galkah vek uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, a nam pumpi in Jordan lui a galkah siang nung un, Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipite lak a mi sawmlehnih, namchih a mi khatzel telkhia inla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiang uah, Jordan luilai, siampute dinna laitak a suangte sawmlehnih la unla, pawphei unla, giahphual, tu zan a na giahna ding uah koih un, chi in thu pia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua in Israel suante lak a mi sawmlehnih, namchih a mi khat zel a telkhiakte a sam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joshua in a kiang uah, “Toupa na Pathian uh ma ah bawm in Jordan luilai ah galkah unla, Israel suante a nam zah zel in, michih in suang khatchiat pua hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiaite na lak uah chiamtehna a honghi dia, tunung chiang in na tate un, hiai suangte bang na chihna uh ahia? chi a a hondot chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou a kiang uah, Toupa thukhun bawm ma a Jordan tuite a hong kan tak ziak in ahi. Jordan a kanlai un, Jordan tuite a hong kitat a ahi. Hiai suangte Israel suante’n tangtawn a a theihgigena ding uh ahi, na chi ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel suante’n Joshua thupiak bang in a hih ua, Israel suante’n a nam zah zel in, Jordan luilai a suang sawmlehnih a la ua; a giahphual uah, a paw phei ua, huai ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thukhun bawm zawng siampute dinna laitak Jordan luilai ah Joshua in huai suang sawmlehnihte a phut a; huaite tunitan in a omlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosi in Joshua thu a na piak tengteng bang a Toupa’n mipite kiang a hih dia Joshua thu a piak a hih zohvek mateng uh siampu bawm zawngte Jordan luilai ah ading nilouh uh. Mipite a kinoh ua, a galkahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, mipi tengteng a galkah siangvek nung un, Toupa bawm leh siampute leng mipi mitmuh in a galkahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte Mosi in a kiang ua a na genkhitsa bang in, Israel suante ma ah kigalvan in a galkah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galvan a kivan dimdiam mi sing li vel galdou din Jeriko phaizang ah Toupa ma ah a galkah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huai ni’n Toupa’n Israel tengteng mitmuh in Joshua a tawisang a; Mosi a lauh mah bang un a damsung teng in amah a lau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah thu a gen a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Siampute, thu theihpihna bawm zawngte Jordan lui apan hongpawt ding in thupia in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joshua in siampute, “Jordan lui apan hong pawtta un” chi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, siampute, Toupa thukhun bawm zawngte Jordan luilai apan a hongpawt ua, siampute khete’n leihul a sik tak in, Jordan tuite a luan ngeina bang un a hongluang nawn ua, a ma mah bang in a kuang ah a luanglet nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipite a kha khatna, ni sawm ni’n Jordan lui apan a pawt ua, Jeriko suahlam pang Gilgal ah giahphual a satta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suang sawmlehnih, Jordan lui apan a puakkhiak uh, Joshua in Gilgal ah a phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel suante kiang ah, “Tunung chiang a na suante un a pate uh, hiai suangte bang chihna ahia? chi a hondot chiang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Israelte’n Jordan lui leihul ah a galkah ua ahi, chi in na suante uh na theisak ding uhi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un nidanglai a Tuipi San i galkah masiah ua, i ma ua a na kangtat sak mah bang in, Toupa na Pathian un Jordan tuite na galkah masiah uh na ma uah a kangtat sak a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei a nam chiteng in Toupa khut a na hat ngei, chih a theih ua, Toupa na Pathian uh tangtawn a a lauh theihna ding un” chi’n a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, Jordan lui khen suahlam a om Amorte kumpipa tengteng leh tuipi gei a om Kanan gam kumpipa tengtengte’n a galkah masiah uh Toupa’n Jordan tuite Israel suante ma ah a kangtat sak, chih a na zak un, Israel suante ziak in a lungtang uh a na zulkhin a, lauthawng lou himhim a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huailai in Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Temta hiam kibawl inla, Israel suante zek a nihveina din sumsak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua in temta hiamte a kibawla, Israel suante Gibeth Haraloth ah a zek uh a sumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joshua in a zeksumna san hiai ahi: Aigupta gam apan pawt tengteng, pasal galdoumi tengteng Aigupta gam apan a pawt khiak nung un lamkal ah gamdai ah a sihkhittak ziak uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan pawt tengteng zeksumsa vek ahi ua; himahleh Aigupta gam apan a pawt ua gamdai a lamkal a piang tengteng bel zeksum ahi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw a ngaihkhiak noplouh ziak ua mipi tengteng, Aigupta gam apan hongpawt galdoumite tan hihman a a omvek tan un Israel suante gamdai ah kum sawmli a vialvak uhi. Toupa’n amau pi leh pute kiang a nawitui leh khuaizu luanna gam kichiam a piak a na chiam, huai gam mu lou dia Toupa a kiang uah a na kichiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A suante uh amau sik a a khan letsakte Joshua in a zek uh a sum sak hi. Lamkal a a zek uh sum a hih louh ziak in zeksum louh a na hi him uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, mipi tengteng zek a sum khit un, a dam mateng uh amau giahphual chiat uah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Tuni in Aiguptate’n nou a hon muhsitna uh noumau apan ka khuk mangta” a chi hi. Huchi in tunitan in huai mun Gilgal a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel suante’n Gilgal ah giahphual a sat ua; Jeriko phaizang ah huai kha, a ni sawmlehli ni’n Paikan Ankuang a lui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paikan khit a zingmah in huai gam a tanghou silngou sohlouh leh vaimim kan a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai gam a buh a nek ni zing apan manna a keta kei a; Israel suante’n manna leng a mu nawn kei uhi. Huai kum in Kanan gam a buh leh bal a ne zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan, Joshua Jeriko khaw kiang chin a, a omlai in a dak a, a entou a, ngai in, a mazawn chin ah mi khat a namsau phawisa tawi in a na ding hi. Joshua in a va naih a, a kiang ah, “Kou lam a pang na hi hia, ka melmate uh lam a pang?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Hilou e, Toupa sepaihte heutu dia hongpai ka hi zaw” a chi hi. Huchi in Joshua lei ah a khupboh a, amah a bia a, a kiang ah, “Ka Toupa’n a sikha kiang ah bang gen ding nei ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa sepaihte heutu in Joshua kiang ah, “Na khepek apan na khedap phel in. Na dinna Mun Siangthou ahi” a chi a; huchi in Joshua in a phelta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeriko khua Israel suante ziak in a kikhak bikbek a; kuamah a pawt kei ua, kuamah leng a lut kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “En in, Jeriko leh a kumpipa uh leh a mi hat hangsante uh na khut ah k’on pekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galdoumi tengteng in khopi kimvel in khatvei na va velsuak phot ding uh. Huchibang in ni guk sung na hih ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampu sagih in bawm malam ah belampa ki pengkul sagih a tawi ding ua, a ni sagih ni’n khopi sagihvei na velsuak ding ua, siampute’n pengkul a mut ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, belampa ki a mutging uh na zak chiang un, mipi tengteng ngaihtak in kikou uhen. Huchi in khopi kulh a chim dia, mipi amau mazawn chiat ah a paitou ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nun tapa Joshua in siampute a sam a, a kiang uah, “Thukhun bawm zawng unla, siampu sagih in Toupa bawm malam ah belampa ki pengkul sagih tawi uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman mipite kiang ah, “Pai zel unla, khopi velsuak un, mi kigalvante Toupa bawm malam ah pai zel uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi a hong hita a, Joshua in mipite kiang a thu a genkhit in Toupa ma a belampa ki pengkul sagih tawi siampu sagihte a pai zel ua, pengkul a mut ua; Toupa thukhun bawm in a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi kigalvante pengkul mut siampute ma ah a pai ua, nungdal mite’n bawm a masuan ua, siampute’n paikawm in pengkul a mut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in mipite kiang ah, “Kikou kei unla, na aw u leng zak hi kei hen. Kikou dia thu k’on piak ni a tun mateng na kam ua apan thu pawtkei hen. Huai hun chiang in na kikou ding uh” chi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa bawm khopi khatvei velh in a velsuak sak a; giahphual ah a pai ua, giahphual ah a giak nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joshua zing khang in a thou a, siampute’n Toupa bawm a zawng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa bawm ma ah belampa ki pengkul sagih tawi siampu sagihte a pai ua, pengkul a mut uh. Mi kigalvante a ma uah a pai ua; nungdalte’n Toupa bawm a hon masuan ua, siampute’n a paikawm un pengkul a mut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni nih ni’n khopi khatvei a velsuak nawn ua, a giahphual uah a kiknawn uh. Huchibang in ni guk a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a ni sagih ni’n zingkhang, phalvak in a thou ua, a hihdan ngeimah un sagihvei a velsuak ua; huai ni kia in khopi sagihvei a velsuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a sagihveina a siampute’n pengkul a muttak un Joshua in mipite kiang ah, “Kikou un: Toupa’n Khopi a hon pekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khopi leh asung a thil om tengteng Toupa hamsiat ahi. Rahab kizuaknu kia, amah leh a inn sung a a kiang a om tengteng bel i mi sawlte uh a na sel ziak in hinghawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nou zaw hamsiat thilte apan kihuikhe hiau un, huchilou in zaw, hamsiat thilte la in noumau mah hamsiat in na omloh kha ding uhi. Israelte giahphual hamsiat a omsak in na buaisak kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dangkasik, dangkaeng, dal leh sik tuium-belsuan teng ahihleh Toupa a tuam ahivek hi. Toupa sum in a koih ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipite a kikou ua, siampute’n pengkul a mut uh. Hichi ahi a, mipite’n pengkul ging a zaktak un, ngaihtak in a kikou ua, kulh a chimta hi. Huchi in mipite a mazawn chiat uah a paitou ua, khopi ah a lut ua, khopi a lata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khopi sung a mi tengteng, numei leh pasal, a neu a lian, bawngpa, belam leh sabiltung teng namsau in a satlum vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in mi nih, gam va enkhete kiang ah, huai kizuaknu inn ah va lut unla, a kiang a na kichiamsa bang un huai numei leh a neih teng honpi khia un, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Enkhemi tangvalte a va lut ua, Rahab, a nu leh pa, a sangamte leh a neih teng a hon pikhia ua, a tanau teng leng a hon pikhia ua; Israelte giahphual pawlam ah a omsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khopi leh asung a thil om teng mei in a halvek ua; dangkasik, dangkaeng, sumeng leh sik tuium-belsuan teng kia Toupa inn a sumkoihna ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Himahleh Rahab kizuaknu leh a neihteng leh a pa inkuante Joshua in a hinghawi vek a; Israelte lak ah tunitan in a tenglai uhi; Jeriko khua enkhe dia Joshua in a misawlte a na humbit ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huailai in Joshua in, Hiai Jeriko khopi hon lamnawn peuhmah Toupa ma ah hamsiat in om hen. A suangphum phummi ta masa leh a kulh kongpite tungkhemi ta tumpen leng hamsiat in om hen, chi in amau a hilh chiatchiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa Joshua kiang ah a om a; gam pumpi ah a min a hong thangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh Israel suante hamsiat thilte ah a hong talekta uhi. Judah nam a Zerah tapa Zabdi, huai tapa Karmi, huai tapa Akan in hamsiat thilte a na lata a, Israel suante tung ah Toupa a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in Jeriko khua apan Bethel suahlam Beth-Aven chin a om Ai khua ah mi a sawl a, a kiang uah, “Va hohtou unla, gam va enkhia un” chi in a gen hi. Mite a va hohtou ua, Ai khua a va enkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua kiang ah a kiknawn ua, a kiang ah, “Mi tengteng hohtou chitchiat kei uhen. Mi sang nih hiam sang thum hiam va hohtou uhenla, Ai khua dou le uh. Mi tengteng va hihgim chitchiat ding ahi kei; tawmchik kia lah ahi ngal ua” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in mipi lak a mi sang thum huai ah a hohtou ua, Aite ma ah a hong taikek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aite’n mi sawmthum leh guk a na that ua; kulh kongpi chin apan Sebarim phahialin a hondelh ua, a kumsukna ah a that uhi. huaiziak in, mite lungtang a zulkhina, tui bang a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in a puante a botkek a, Toupa bawm ma ah amah leh Israel upate a mai ua leisi in nitaklam tan in a khupboh uh. A lu uah leivui a buak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua in, “Maizen! Toupa Pathian aw, bang ding in ahia, hiai mipite hih manthat dia, Amorte khut a piak dia, Jordan lui na pi galkai mahmah? Jordan luigal ah lungkimtakin om hiathiat zaw mai le ung!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, hichi a melmate delh a Israelte a taikek mawk uh bang ka lohta dia oi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kanante leh hiai gam a tengte’n a za ding ua, a honum ding ua, lei apan ka min uh hih mangthang ding eita ve ua. Na min thupi bang na chihta dia leh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n, Joshua kiang ah, “Thou in, Bang a chia Khupboh nilouh na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelte’n thil a hihkhial ua; zuih dia ka piak ka thukhun ah a talek ua, hamsiat thilte a la ua, a gu na lai ua, a sim im behlap ua, amau vanlak mahmah ah a simsel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in ahi, Israel suante’n a melmate uh zoulou a, a melmate apan a taikek uh. Hamsiat in a omta ua ahi. Hamsiat a om pen na lak ua pan na hihmang kei leh k’on ompih nawn kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Thou inla, mipite hihsiangthou photmai in’. A kiang uah, Zingchiang adin ki hihsiangthou un. Toupa Israelte Pathian in, Israelte aw, na lak uah hamsiat thil a om a ahi. Na lak ua pan hamsiat thil na lakmang masiah uh na melmate uh na zou theikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingchiang in a chichi a, na hong kilat ding uh ahi. Hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n huai chi a na mat pen a namnam a na hong kilat nawn ding uh ahi. Toupa’n huai nam a na mat pen a inkuan kuan ua a hong kilat nawn ding uh ahi. Toupa’n huai inkuan a na mat pen a malmal a a hong kilat nawn ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, kuapeuh hamsiat thil na la peuhmah, amah leh a neih tengteng mei a halvek ding ahi. Toupa thukhun a tatlek san ziak leh, Israelte lak a thil gilou haihuai tak a hih ziak in, a chi” na chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joshua zingkhang in a thou a, Israelte a chichi in a hong kilang sak a; Judah namte mat a hong hita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah namte a hong kilang sak nawn a; Zerah namte a na man a; Zerahte inkuante a malmal in a hong kilang nawn ua; Zabdi mat a na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A inkuante a malmal in a hong kilang sak nawn a; huchi in Judah chi a Zerah tapa Abadi, huai tapa Karmi, huai tapa Akan mat a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joshua in Akan kiang ah, “Ka tapa, Toupa , Israelte Pathian thupina pia inla; a kiang ah kiphuang in. Na thilhih honhilh in. Kei kiang ah im ken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akan in Joshua a dawng a, a kiang ah, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian tung ah thil ka na hihkhialta hi, hichibang in ahi ka na hih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Gallak lak a Babulon puan hoihtak leh, dangka sekel za nih leh dangkaeng tang sekel sawmnga buk ka mu a, ka enlah lua a, ka la mai hi. Ngai in, ka puanin sung a lei a selguk ahi a, dangka pen huai nuai ah a om’ ” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in mite a sawl a, puanin sung ah a vatai ua; ngai in, a puanin ah selguk ahi ngei a, a nuai ah dangka a na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puanin sung a kipan a la ua, Joshua leh Israel suan tengteng kiang ah a hontawi ua; amau Toupa ma ah a koih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joshua leh Israel tengteng in Zerah tapa Akan dangka, puan, dangkaeng tang, a tapate, a tanute, a bawngpa, a sabiltungte, a belamte, a puanin leh a neih tengteng toh a pi ua; Akor guam ah a paitouh pih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joshua in, “Bangdia honhih mangbang na hia? Toupa’n tuni in nang leng a honhih mangbang ding hi” a chi hi. Huchi in Israel tengteng in suang in a deng ua; suang a a denkhit un mei in a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tung ah suang a chiang vum ua, tunitan in a omlai hi. Huchi in Toupa’n a heh petmahna a kiheisan hi. huaiziak in, huai mun min tunitan in Akor guam a chilai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Lau ken, lunglel sam ken. Galdou thei tengteng tonpih inla, thou inla, Ai khua ah hohtou in. Ngai in, Ai khaw kumpipa, a mite, a khua leh a gam na khut ah k’on peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeriko leh a kumpipa uh tung a na hih bang in, Ai khua leh a kumpipa tung ah leng na hih ding hi. Gallak leh gante kia nou a tuam din nei un. Khopi nung ah guktan un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua leh galdou thei tengteng Ai khua a hohtou din a kisata uh. Joshua in mi hat hangsan sing thum a telkhia a, zan in a sawlkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Ngai un, khopi nunglam ah khopi dou din guktan un. Khopi apan gamla lua ah pai kei unla, mansa in om gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei leh ka kiang a om tengteng in khopi ka honzuan ding uh. Hichi ahi ding a, tuma a mah bang in hongdou dia a hongpawt tak un, a ma uah i taikek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hondelh din a hongpawt ding ua, khua apan gamla sim i ki hepkhiak tan in. Amau, ‘Tuma a mah bang in i ma uah taikek uh e,’ a chi ding ua; a ma uah i taikek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Guktanna apan na hong pawtkhe ding ua, khopi na la ding uhi. Toupa na Pathian un na khut uah a honpe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding a, khopi na lak chiang un, khopi na hal ding uh. Toupa thu bangzel in na hih ding uh ahi. Ngai un, thu k’on pekhin hi” chi in, thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joshua in a kuansakta a, guktanna mun ah a hoh ua, Ai khaw tumlam ah Bethel leh Ai khaw kikal ah a om uh. Joshua bel huai zan in mipite lak ah a giak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zingkhang in Joshua a thou a, mipite a kaikhawm a, amah leh Israel upate mipite ma ah Ai kholam ah a hohtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi tengteng, a kiang a galdou thei omte tan in a hohtou ua, a va zuan ua, khopi chin ah a hohtou ua, Ai khaw mallam pang ah a giaktou uh. Ai khua toh a kikal uah guam a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sang nga a tonpih a, khopi tumlam a Bethel leh Ai khaw kikal ah a guktan sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite, khopi mallam a sepaihte panmun leh khopi tumlam a guktanmite panmun hoihtak in a sep a; Joshua huai zan in guam lak ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Ai khaw kumpipa’n huai a muhtak in, kintak in zingkhang in a thou a, huai khua a mite leh amah leh a lawite tengteng toh, a munseh Arabah zawn ah Israelte dou ding in a pawtta hi. Himahleh khaw nunglam ah amah dou din guktanmi a om uh chih a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joshua leh Israel tengteng zohsa bangtak in a om ua, gamdai lampi ah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khopi a om tengteng amau delh din a samkhawm ua; huchi in Joshua a delh ua, khopi apan gamla sim ah khemkhiak in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai khua ah leh Bethel khua ah Israelte delhlou khat leng a omkei ua; khopi bangmah loukal a pawtsan in Israelte a delhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Na teipi tawi Ai kholam nga in lik in. Na khut a honpe ding ka hi” a chi hi. Joshua in a teipi khopi lamnga in a likta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Guktan mite a omna ua kipan a hong paikhe guih ua, a khut a zaktakin a tai ua, khopi ah a lutua, a lata ua; khua a halpah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aite’n a nunglam uh a et uleh, ngai in, khopi meikhu vanlam a khutou a mu ua, a koilam lam ah leng tai theihna himhim a neikei ua; Gamdai a tai delhte’n a na lehdelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua leh Israel tengteng in guktanmite’n khopi a lak ua, khopi meikhu paitou a muhtak un a kiknawn ua, Aite a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Midangte amau dou din khopi sung apan a hong pawtkhia ua Israelte’n a kaltehta uhi. A khen a langkhat ah, a khen a langkhat ah a om uhi. Huchi in a that ua, khatlel leng hawi leh khah a neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ai khaw kumpipa a hingmat ua, Joshua kiang ah a honpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Israelte’n Ai khaw mi gamlak a om tengteng, gamdai gam a amau a vadelhna mun uah namsau in a thatvek uhi. Huaikhit in Israelte tengteng Ai khua ah a kiknawn ua, asung a om tengteng namsau in a vathat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai ni a si tengteng numei leh pasal sing khat leh sang nih ahi ua, Ai khua a pasal teng a sikhin vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joshua in lah a teipi likna khut Aite tengteng a hihman keuhkeuh masiah a kaikik kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua thu a piak a, hihdia a chih bangbang in huai khopi a gante leh gallakte kia Israelte a tuamdin a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joshua in Ai khua a hala, tangtawn adin leivum in a bawl a, tunitan in loihsan ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ai khaw kumpipa nitak tan in sing dawn ah a khai a; nitum kuan in Joshua in thu a pia a, huchi in a luang singdawn apan a lakhia ua, khopi kulh kongpi lutna ah a pai ua, a tung ah suang a vum ua, tunitan in a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joshua in Ebal tang ah Toupa , Israel Pathian adin maitam a doh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi dan laibu a gelhsa bang in, Toupa sikha Mosi in Israel suante a na piaksa bang in, seklouh suangte, kuamah in sik a a sekngei nai hetlouhte in maitam a bawl hi. Huai ah Toupa adin haltum thillatte a lan a, lemna thillatte leng a lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huai ah Israel mite muh mah in Mosi dan gelhsa huai suangte tung ah a teisawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel tengteng, gamdang mi hi in, tualsung mi hita leh avekpi un, a upate uh, a makaite uh leh vaihawmmite toh Toupa thukhun bawm sik tuak ah ading uhi. Amau huai bawm zawng Levi siampute mai ah huai bang in ading uhi. Amau kikim khen in, a kimkhat Gerizim tang mazawn ah ading ua, a kimkhat dang Ebal tang mazawn ah ading uhi. Toupa sikha Mosi in Israelte vualzawl dia thu a hilhlai in, hiai bang a hih din thu a na pekhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huaikhit in Joshua in danthu teng, vualzawlna thu leh hamse thu tengteng a sim a, dan laibu a kigelh tengteng bang in a simkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mosi thupiak tengteng Israel omkhawm tengteng leh numeite leh naupang neu chikte leh a lak ua namdang omte ma ah Joshua in simlouh himhim a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Jordan gal a kumpipa tengteng, tang a omte, phaizang a omte, tuipi zatak dung teng a Lebanon pha a om tengteng, Hitte, Amorte, Kanante, Perizte, Hivte leh Jebuste’n a na zak un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua leh Israelte pheikhai khat a dou tum in a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Gibeon khomite’n Joshua in Jeriko khua leh Ai khua a bawl dan a na zak un, lepchiah pil in a gamtang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Palai a kibawl in iplui pipi, uain thawllui pipi, a sesa kithuap nemnum sabiltungte a pua in mi a kisawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khedap lui thuap nennon a bun ua, puan lui pipi a silh ua, a nekding tanghoute uh gaw gemgom, ap khetkhut ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gilgal giahphual ah Joshua kiang ah a va hoh ua, a kiang leh Israelte kiang ah, “Gamlapi apan hongpai ka hi ua, huaiziak in tuin kou leh nou lemna thu khung ni” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israelte’n huai Hivte kiang ah, “Ka lak ua teng hi kha ni u chia; bangchi’n nou toh lemna thu i khung thei dia?” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau Joshua kiang ah,“Na sikhate ka hi uh,” a chi uhi. Joshua in a kiang uah, “Kuate na hi ua? Koilam apan hongpai na hi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau a kiang ah, “ Toupa a Pathian min uh ka zak ziak un na sikhate gamlapi apan hongpai ka hi uh. A minthan dan, Aigupta gam a a thilhih tengteng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan lui gal a Amorte kumpipa nihte, Heshbon gam kumpipa Sihon, Bashan gam kumpipa Astaroth khua a om Og tung a a thilhih tengteng ka naza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka upate uh leh ka gam ua tengte’n ka kiang uah, ‘Lampi a nekding tawi unla, amau vahoupih un, a kiang uah, “Na sikha ka hi uh. Nou toh kilem ni, na va chi ding uh”’ chi’n a honsawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hiai ka nekding uh tanghoute na kiang a hongdia kongpawt ni ua ka inn ua kipan a sa a k’on puak uh ahi. Himahleh tuin en dih, a gaw gemgoma a ap khetkhutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai thawl uain ka thunnate uh leng a thak ahi. En dih, a vang khinvek hi. Hiai ka puante uh leh ka khedapte uh leng ka hong paina uh a gamla mahmah a, a luigawpta hi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite’n a tawi uh nek leh dawn dingte a chiam ua, Toupa dong in thu a kan masa kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua in amau toh kilemna a bawl a, amaute hawi din amau toh thu a khungta hi. Paikhawm miliante leng a kiang uah a kichiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a kiang ua thu a khun ua kipan ni thum nung in, a khopite uh amau kiang nai a tengsam ahi uh, chih a thei kheta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel suante a kipan khia ua, a ni thum ni’n a khopite uh a va tung uhi. A khopite uh Gibeon, Kephirah, Beeroth leh Kiriath-jearim ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paikhawm miliante’n Toupa , Israelte Pathian minlou a a kiang ua a na kichiamtak ziak un, Israel suante’n a khoih kei uh. Huchi in paikhawm tengteng miliante tung ah a phun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh milian tengteng in paikhawm tengteng kiang ah, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian minlou in a kiang uah i na kichiamta ngal ua. Huaiziak in amaute i khoih uh sianglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichibang in a tung uah hih ni. I hinghawi mai ding uh. Huchi lou in zaw i tung uah thangpaihna a hongtung kha ding, a kiang uah lah i na kichiam khinta ngal ua” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miliante mah in a kiang uah, “Hinghawi in om uhen. Himahleh paikhawm tengteng adia sing pawmite leh tui tawimite hi uhen” a chi uhi; miliante’n a na chiamkhit tak bang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in amaute a samsaka, a kiang uah, “Bangdia, gamlapi apan hongpai ka hi uh, chi a hon zekhem na hi ua? Ka kiang nai a tengsam lah na hi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin hamsiat na hi uh, na lak ua mi kuamah ka Pathian inn adia singpawmi leh tuitawimi na hihna ua pan a suakta ngeikei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amau Joshua a dawng ua, “ Toupa na Pathian un a sikha Mosi gam pumpi nou honpe dia, a gam luah mi tengteng na ma ua kipan a hihmang zel ding ahi, chih thu a na piak, na sikhate a hon na hilhchian mahmah ua; huaiziak in noute ziak a ka hinna uh mansuah ka lau mahmah ua, hichibang in ka gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin ngai in, na khut a om ka hi ua; na ngaihtuahna a hoih leh dik a na theih bang in ka tung uah hihmai in” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Israel suante apan Joshua in hunkhia in, a thatta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai ni’n Joshua in a seh bang in paikhawmte leh Toupa maitam adia singpawmite leh tuitawimite in a sep a, tunitan in hiaite in a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Jerusalem khaw kumpipa Adoni zedek in Joshua in Ai khua a la a, a hihsegawp dimdem a, Jeriko khua leh a kumpipa a hihsiat bang in Ai khua leh a kumpipa leng a hihse gawp a, Gibeon khua a mite’n Israelte toh lemna bawl in, a lak uah a tengsam uh, chih a zak in, a lauta mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon khua bel lianpi, kumpipa khopite lak a khat bang a lian ahi. Ai khua sang a lianzaw leh a mite leng hattak a hih ziak un a lau mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in Jerusalem kumpipa Adonizedek in Hebron khaw kumpipa Hoham, Jermuth khaw kumpipa Piram, Lakis khaw kumpipa Japhia leh Eglon khaw kumpipa Debir kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hongpai unla, hong panpih un, Gibeon i vadou ding uh. Joshua leh Israel suante toh lemna a bawl ngal ua” chi in a thukhak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amorte kumpipa ngate: Jerusalem kumpipa, Hebron kumpipa, Jermuth kumpipa, Lakis kumpipa leh Eglon kumpipa a kikhawm ua, a sepaih tengteng utoh a hohtou ua, Gibeon khozawn ah giahphual sat in a douta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gibeonte’n Gilgal a giahphual ua Joshua kiang ah mi a sawl ua, “Na sikhate hon nusia ken. Kintak in ka kiang uah hongtou inla, hong hondam inla, hong panpih in. Singtang gam a teng Amor kumpipate kou hong dou din a kikhawm uh” chi in a va hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua leh a kiang a galdou thei mi tengteng leh mi hat hangsan tengteng Gilgal apan a hohtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Amaute lau hetken. Na khut ah k’on pekhinta hi. A lak ua mi kuamah na ma ah ading zoukei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />huaiziak in Joshua in amaute a dou guih a; zankhua a Gilgal apan a a na hohtousa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n Israelte ma ah amaute a hihbuai gawpta a, Gibeon khua ah tampi a that a, Bethhoron zottouhna lampi ah a delh a, Azek leh Maked khaw pha in a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Israelte ma ah a taikek ua, Bethhoron apan a paisukna mun a a omlai un, Toupa’n van apan gial lianpipi a tung uah Azek khaw pha in a kesak a, a si uhi. Israel suante’n namsau a satlup sang un gial denlup a tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n Amorte Israel suante a piak ni’n Joshua in Toupa kiang ah thu a gen a; Israelte mitmuh in, “Ni, Gibeon khaw tung ah ding nilouh in; kha, nang leng, Aijalon guam ah om nilouh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mite’n a melmate uh tung a phu a lak masiah uh ni ading kinken a, kha leng a om nilouh hi. Hiai thu Jasar laibu a gelh hilou hia? Huchi in ni vanlai ah a om nilouh a, ni khat sung vengveng tum thu a ngaihtuah kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n huchibang a mihing aw a ngaihkhiak ni, a ma in a om ngeikei a, a nung in leng a om ngeikei; Toupa’n lah Israelte a doupih ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joshua leh Israelte a giahphual uh Gilgal ah a kiknawn vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai kumpipa ngate a taimang ua, Maked kawkhuk ah a kibu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Kumpipa ngate muh ahi ua, Makeddah kawkhuk ah a kibu uh” chi in Joshua hilh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua in, “Kawkhuk kam suang lianpi khuk in sin unla, a vengmite leng omsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute bel omkei unla; na melmate uh delh unla, a nungdalte that unla; a khua himhim uah lutsak kei un. Toupa na Pathian un na khut uah amau a hon peta ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Joshua leh Israel suante’n a bei masiah ua a thah khit un, kulhpi nei khuate a, a omlaite a tailut khit un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />mi tengteng Joshua kiang Makkedah ah galmuangtak in a hong kiknawn ua. Israel suante dem in kuamah in lei a lok ngamkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in, “Kawkhuk kam hong unla, kumpipa ngate kawkhuk apan ka kiang ah hon kaikhia un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hichibang in a hih ua, kumpipa ngate: Jerusalem kumpipa, Hebron kumpipa, Jermuth kumpipa, Lakis kumpipa leh Eglon kumpipa kawkhuk apan a kiang ah a hon pikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kumpipate Joshua kiang a a honpi tak un, Joshua in Israel tengteng a samkhawm a, amah toh kuan galdou thei mite lak a heutute kiang ah, “Hong painai unla, hiai kumpipate ngawng sik un,” a chi hi. Huchi in a hong painai ua, a ngawng uh a hong siksak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Joshua in a kiang uah, “Lau kei unla, lunglel sam kei un. Hattak leh hangsantak in om un. Na dou uh na melma tengteng tung ah Toupa’n hichibang in a hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaikhit in Joshua in amau a satzan a, a that a, sing nga dawn ah a khai a; nitaklam tan in singdawn ah a kikhai lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, ni tumkuan in Joshua in thu a pia a, sing dawn apan a lakhia ua, a kibukna kawkhuk ah a pailut ua, a kawkhuk kam suang lianpi in a sin ua, tunitan in leng a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joshua in huai ni’n Makkedah khua a la a, a kumpipa uh tan in namsau in a lok a; huai khua a om tengteng a satlum vek a, khat lel leng hawi a neikei hi. Jeriko khaw kumpipa tung a a hihmah bang in, Makkedah khaw kumpipa tung ah leng a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joshua Israel tengteng toh Makkedah khua apan Libnah khua ah a pai ua, Libnah khua a dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Toupa’n huai khua kumpipa tan in Israelte khut ah a pia hi. Huai khua dou in asung a om tengteng a thatvek hi. Asung a ommi khatmah leng hinghawi a neikei hi. Jeriko khaw kumpipa tung a a hihmah bang in a kumpipa tung ah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joshua Israel tengteng toh Libnah khua apan Lakis khua ah a pai ua, panmun a khoh ua, a sual uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Toupa’n Lakis khua Israelte khut ah a pia a, a ni nih ni’n a la ua, huai khua dou in asung a om tengteng namsau in a thatvek ua, Libnah khaw tung a, a hih bang in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bezer khaw kumpipa Horam, Lakis khua panpih din a kuantou a; Joshua in amah leh a heute nasan khatmah leng hawilou in a thatgam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Joshua Israel tengteng toh Lakis khua apan Eglon khua ah a pai ua, panmun a khoh ua; a dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai ni’n a la ua, huai ni mah in huai khua dou in asung a om tengteng namsau in a thatbei sipsip hi. Lakis khaw tung a a hih bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joshua, Israelte tengteng toh Eglon khua apan Hebron khua ah a pai ua; a dou uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A la ua, huai khua, a kumpipa, a khopel tengteng leh asung a om tengteng namsau a dou in a thatvek ua, Eglon khaw tung a hih bang in khat mah leng hinghawi a neikei hi. A khua nangawn hihse vek in asung a om tengteng a that bei sipsip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Joshua leh Israel tengteng Debir khua ah a kihei nawn ua; a dou ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />huai khua, a kumpipa leh a khopel tengteng a la ua; namsau in a dou ua, asung a om tengteng a that bei sipsip ua; khatmah leng hawi a neikei uh. Hebron khaw tung leh Debir khua leh a kumpipa uh tung a hih bang in a hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua in a gam pumpi, tang gamte, simlam a phaizang leh mual gamte hihse vek in a kumpipa tengteng uh a thatvek a; khatmah hinghawi a neikei hi. Toupa , Israelte Pathian thupiak bang in a hing peuhmah a hih chimit vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Joshua in Kadesh-barnea apan Gaza pha in, Gosen gam tengteng toh Gibeon pha in a hihse vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huai kumpipate tengteng leh a gam uh Toupa , Israelte Pathian in Israelte a doupih ziak in, Joshua in hun khat a a lakvek ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Joshua leh Israel tengteng a giahphual Gilgal ah a kiknawn vek uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Hazor khaw kumpipa Jabin in huai a zak in, Madon khaw kumpipa Jobab, Simron khaw kumpipa leh Aksaph khaw kumpipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mallam tanggam kumpipate, Kineroth simlam a Arabah kumpipate, Phaigam kumpipate leh tumlam pang a Doron kumpipate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suahlam leh tumlam a om Kanan mite, tanggam a om, Amorte, Hitte, Perizte, Jebuste, Mizpah gam Hermon tang nuai a om Hivte kiang ah mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, a sepaih tengteng utoh mi tampi, a tamdan uh tuipi a piaunel zah mahmah, sakol leh kangtalai tampi toh a kisa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai kumpipa tengteng a kimu khawm ua, Israelte dou din Merom tuite ah a giakkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n Joshua kiang ah, “Amaute lau ken. Zingchiang in hichih hun in amaute hihlupsa vek in Israelte k’on pemai ding hi. A sakolte khukguh na kilawisak dia, a kangtalaite uh na halsak ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua leh galdou theimi tengteng Merom tuite ah a va kuanguih ua, a dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n Israelte khut ah a pia a, a dou ua, Zidon lianzaw pha in, Misrephoth maim munte pha in, suahlam pang a Mizpeh guamte pha in a delh ua; khat leng hawi neilou in a thatvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n a sawl bang in Joshua in a tung uah a hih a; a sakolte khukguh a kilawi sak ua, a kangtalaite uh a halsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai hun in Joshua a kileh hei a, Hazor khua a la a, a kumpipa uh namsau in a that hi. Tuma in Hazor khua huailai a hiai gamte tengteng lak a khopi pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai khua a om tengteng namsau in a that vek a, a hih chimit vek a, a hing peuhmah khatmah leng a hinghawi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in Kumpipate khopi tengteng leh a kumpipa tengteng uh Joshua in a man vek a, namsau a dou in a that a, a hih chimit vek a; Toupa sikha Mosi in thu a piak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mualpawng a khopi a na om khinsate, Hazor khua chihlouh, Israelte’n khatmah leng a hal kei uh. Huai khua bel Joshua in a hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai khopite a gallak tengteng leh gante Israel suante’n amau a tuam ding in a nei ua; mihing bel a hihman vek masiah uh namsau in a that zel ua, a hing peuhmah hawi a neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n a sikha Mosi thu a piak bang in, Mosi in huai thu Joshua a pesawn a; Joshua in huai bang in a hihzel hi. Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak tengteng hihlouh himhim a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai bang in Joshua in huai gam tengteng, tanggamte, sim gam tengteng, Gosen gam tengteng, guam leh phaizang teng leh Israelte tangte leh phaizang teng toh a la vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Seir tang va suntou Halak tang apan Hermon tang nuai a Lebanon guam a Baal gad pha in; a kumpipate tengteng uh a man a, that in a hihlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua in huai kumpipa tengteng sawtpi tak a dou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon khua a om Hivte kia chihlouh Israelte toh lemna bawl khua a omkei uh. Dou a lakvek ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang a, a hih chimit vek a, deihsakna nei hetlou a, a hihman theihna dia a lungtang uh hih khauhsak a Israelte dou sakpa Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huailai in Joshua a kuan a, tanggamte apan, Hebron khua apan, Debir khua apan, Anab khua leh Judia tanggam tengteng leh Israel tanggam tengteng apan Anakimte a hihmang vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel suante gam ah Anakimte khat lel leng a tengta kei ua; Gaza, Gath leh Ashdod khuate kia ah bel a omlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Mosi kiang a, a gen tengteng bang in Joshua in gam pumpi a lata hi. Joshua in Israelte a nam uh kikhen dan bangzel in a gouluah ding un gam a pe chiat hi. Huchi in gam galmuang in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaite ahi uh huai gam kumpipate, Israel suante’n a hihman ua, a gam uh Jordan luigal, nisuahna lam gamte, Arnon guam apan Hermon tang tan, suahlam pang a Arabah tengteng toh a neihsak uh kumpipate:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amorte kumpipa Sihon, Heshbon a teng in Arnon guam pang a om Aroer khua apan vai a hawm a, guam laitak a khopite, Ammon suante gamgi Jabok lui pha in Gilead gam kimkhat tung ah vai a hawm hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suahlam ah Arabah ah Kineroth dil tan in ahi a; suahlam ah Beth jeshimoth hohna lampi lam ah Arabah tuipi, Chi tuipi tan in ahi a; simlam ah Pisgah tang nuai pha in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Astaroth leh Edre-i khua a om Rephaim nam omsunte lak ah Bashan kumpipa Og in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah Hermon tang, Salka khua leh Bashan tengteng, Geshurte leh Maakatte gamgi pha leh Heshbon kumpipa Sihon gamgi chiang Gilead gam kimkhat pha in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa sikha Mosi leh Israel suante’n huaite a that ua; Toupa sikha Mosi in Reuben chite, Gad chite, Manasseh nam kimkhatte a gouluah ding un a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai gam Kumpipate ahi, Joshua leh Israel suante’n Jordan lui gal tumlam pang a, a thahte uh, Lebanon guam Baal gad apan Seir tang suntou Halak tang pha in. Joshua in Israel suante a kikhen dan bangzel un huai gam a gouluah ding un a pe chiatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tanggam a, phaizang gamte, Arabahte, tanggamte, gamdai gamte, sim gamte; huaite bel Hit mite, Amor mite, Kanan mite, Periz mite, Hiv mite, Jebus mite gam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jeriko Khaw Kumpipa khat; Bethel khosik a Ai khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw kumpipa khat; Hebron khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmuth khaw kumpipa khat; Lakis khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon khaw kumpipa khat; Gezer khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir khaw kumpipa khat; Geder khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hormah khaw kumpipa khat; Arad khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Libnah khaw kumpipa khat; Adullam khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Makkedah khaw kumpipa khat; Bethel khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tapuah khaw kumpipa khat; Hepher khaw kumpipa, khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aphek khaw kumpipa khat; Lasaron khaw kumpipa, khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Madon khaw kumpipa khat; Hazor khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimron meron khaw kumpipa khat; Aksaph khaw kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Taanak khaw kumpipa khat; Magiddo khaw kumpipa, khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kedesh khaw kumpipa khat; Karmel tang a Jokneam khaw kumpipa, khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dor tuipang a Dor khaw kumpipa, khat; Gilgal a Goiim namte kumpipa khat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tirzah khaw kumpipa khat; kumpipa tengteng sawmthum leh khat ahi uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua a hong upata a, a hong tek mahmah ta hi. Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Na hong upa in na hongtek mahmahta a, gam lak ding lah a tamlai mahmah ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai gamte ahi lak louh: Philistia gam tengteng leh Geshur gam tengteng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta gam chin a om Sihor apan mallam pang a Ekron gamgi tan in, huai bel Kanan mite gam a sim ahi; Philistiate toupa ngate, Gaza mite, Ashdod mite, Ashkelon mite, Git mite leh Ekron mite; simlam a Avi mite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kanan mite gam tengteng leh Zidon mite gam a Mearah, Amorte gamgi Aphek khaw pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gebal mite gam leh nisuahna lam Lebanon gam tengteng Hermon tang nuai Baal gad apan Hamath kholutna pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lebanon apan Misrephoth maim mun pha in, tanggam a teng tengteng, Zidon mi tengteng. Amaute Israel suante ma ah ka delhkhe dia; k’on thupiak bang in Israel gouluah din bawlsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in hiai gam nam kuate leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte gouluah din hawmsak in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa sikha Mosi in amau adia a sehsak bang in Reuben suante leh Gad suante’n Manasseh nam kimkhat dangte toh Mosi piaksa Jordan suahlam gam ah goutan a neita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai gam ahihleh Arnon guam gei a om Aroer khua apan leh guam laitak a khopi leh Medeba phai gam tengteng, Dibon tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amorte kumpipa Sihon, Heshbon khua a Kumpipa a tu khopi tengteng Ammon suante gamgi tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead gam leh Geshurte leh Maakatte gamgi chiang leh Hermon tang tengteng leh Bashan gam tengteng Salkah khaw tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Astaroth leh Edre-i khua a kumpipa a tu Bashan gam kumpipa Og gam tengteng toh, huaite Rephaim nam milian omsunte ahi uh; huaite Mosi in a na dou a, a na delhkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh Geshurte leh Maakatte Israel suante’n a delhkhe kei ua; Geshurte leh Maakatte tunitan in Israelte lak ah a tengden lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi namte kia ahi gouluah ding a piak louh. A kiang ua a na gensa bang in Toupa , Israelte Pathian adia mei a thillatte amau gouluah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Reuben suante nam a inkuan dungzui in Mosi in gam a na peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A gamgi uh Arnon guam pang a om Aroer khua apan guam laitak a khopi leh Medeba phaigam tengteng apan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heshbon leh huai phaigam a khopi tengteng; Debon, Bamoth baal, leh Beth baal meon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jahaz, Kedemoth leh Mephaath;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim, Sibmah leh guam gei a Zereth sahar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth peor leh Ashdot pisgah leh Beth jeshimoth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phai gam khopi tengteng, Heshbon a vaihawm Amorte Kumpipa Sihon lalgam teng, Mosi in a na thah khitsa Midiante kumpipate Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur leh Reba omna gam toh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beor tapa Balaam, aisansiam leng a inkuante toh Israel suante’n a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Reuben suante gam chiang bel Jordan leh a pang teng ahi. Hiai gam leh a khopite leh khuate ahi Reuben suante adia a inkuan omdan bangzel a gouluah dia a sehsak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosi in Gad suante a inkuan dungzui un gam a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A gamgi uh Jazer khua leh Gilead gam khopi tengteng leh Ammon suante gam kimkhat, Rabah khaw kiang a om Aroer pha in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon apan Ramath mizpeh leh Betonim pha in; Mahanaim apan Debir gamgi pha in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Guam ah Betharam, Bethnimarah, Sukoth, Zaphon, Heshbon kumpipa Sihon gam teng, Jordan leh a gei a gamte, Jordan gal suahlam pang a Kinereth dil tawp chiang tan in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hiai Gad suante adia a inkuan omdan bangzel a a gouluah ding ua seh, a khopite uh leh a khuate uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosi in Manasseh suan kimkhatte gam a pia hi. Manasseh suan kimkhatte adia a inkuan omdan bangzel a piak ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A gamgi uh Mahanaim apan Bashan gam tengteng, Bashan gam kumpipa Og gam tengteng leh Bashan gam a Jair khopi tengteng toh, khua sawmguk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead gam kimkhat leh Bashan gam kumpipa Og gam a Astaroth, Edre-i; huai Manasseh tapa Makir suan, Makir suan kimkhatte adia a inkuan uh omdan bangzel a seh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiaite Moab phai, Jeriko zawn, Jordan gal lehlam a, Mosi in gouluah dia a piak gamte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Levi chite Mosi in gouluah ding a pe kei hi. A kiang ua a na gensa bang in Toupa , Israelte Pathian a gouluah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaite ahi Israel suante’n Kanan gam a lak ua, siampu Eleazar, Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel suante nam inkuan intekpente’n a gouluah ding ua a na hawm uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam kuate leh nam kimkhatte a tuam dia Toupa’n Mosi zang a thu a na piak bang in aisan in a gouluah uh piak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosi in nam nih leh nam kimkhatte Jordan gal ah a gouluah ding uh a na peta hi. Levi chite bel a lak uah gouluah ding a pe kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joseph suante nam nih ahi ua, Manasseh leh Ephraim. Levi chite huai gam ah tantuam a pe kei uh, a omna ding uh khopite leh a daikim ua gantatna ding mun leh a inn leh a lou uh bawlna ding loungal piak ahi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi thu a piak bang in Israel suante’n a hih ua, gam a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah suante Gilgal khua ah Joshua kiang ah a va hoh ua; Keniz mi Jephunneh tapa Kaleb in a kiang ah, “Kadesh-barnea mun a Pathian mi Mosi kiang a Toupa’n ka tungtang leh na tungtang thu a na gen na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa sikha Mosi in Kadesh-barnea mun apan gam va enkhe dia a hon sawllai in kum sawmli a upa ka na hita a; ka lungsim a om bangtak a kiang ah ka tun nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh ka unau ka kiang a paisamte’n mipite lungtang a tuisuak sak ua; ken bel Toupa ka Pathian ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi in huai ni’n, Toupa ka Pathian na zuih ziak in na khe in a na siksa gam tangtawn in nang leh na suante gouluah ahi ngeingei ding, chi in a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in ngai in, Toupa’n Mosi kiang a huai thute a gen nung Israelte gamdai a, a vakvaih sung un Toupa’n a gensa bang in kum sawmli leh nga tak a hon damsak hi. Ngai in, tuin kum sawmgiat leh nga ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hichi pipi in leng Mosi in a hon sawllai mah bang in ka hatlai a, nidanglai a kidouna ding leh nasep silbawlna dia thagui ka neih mah bang in tuin leng ka neilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in hiai tang, Toupa’n huai ni a a gensa pen honpia in. Anakimte a om ua, a khopite uh a thupi a, kulh a umsuak ahi uh, chih huai ni’n na za a; Toupa’n a hon ompih dia, amaute ka delhkhe thei ding, Toupa’n a na gensa bang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joshua in a vualzawl a; Jephunneh tapa Kaleb a gouluah din Hebron khua a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Hebron khua tunitan in Keniz mi, Jephunneh tapa Kaleb gouluah a hong hita hi; Toupa Israelte Pathian a zuih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hebron khaw min a ma in Kiriath Arba ahi. Arba ahihleh Anakimte lak a mi thupipen ahi. Huaikhit in a gam a hong galmuangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai Judah suante a inkuan dungzui a amau a tuamdia seh a om ahi: Edom gamgi chiang, simlam pang Zin gamdai tanhial in, simtawp tanpha in a kizalh suk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simlam gamgi bel, chi Tuipi sim tawp a tuipi gamgeng apan simlam doh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simlam zuan in Akrabbim tan in a pai zel a, Zin a va tung hi. Kadesh-barnea simlam ah a tungkah a, Hebron a vatung a, Adar ah a toupai a, Karka a kualkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmon ah a pai zel a, Aigupta luita ah a tuakkhia a; tuipi ah gamgi a tawp hi. Hiai bel simlam pang gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suahlam pang gamgi bel Chi Tuipi ahi a, Jordan ah a tawp hi. Mallam pang gamgi bel tuipi tuimeng apan Jordan tun tawp chiang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-hoglah ah a toupai a, Beth-arabah mal ah a pai zel a; Reuben tapa Bohan suang ah a paitou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akor guam apan Debir ah a paitou a, lui simlama om Adumim a tungkahna chin ah Gilgal lam zuan in mallam ah a pai zel a; En-semes tuite ah a paipai a, En-rogel ah a suakkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinam tapa guam ah Jebuste gam pang simlam, huai bel Jerusalem ahi, pha in a paitou a; Hinnom tang lampang guam chin a om tangvum ah a paitou a, huai bel Rephaim mallam pang guam tawp mahmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangvum apan Nephtoah a lui tuite pha in a paisuak a, Ephron tang a khopite ah a pai zel a; gamgi Baalah, huai bel Kiriath-jearim ahi, lam ah a paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Baalah apan tumlam pang ah Seir tang pha in a kihekkual nawn a, mallam pang ah Jearim, huai bel Kesalon ahi, tang zul ah a paisuk a, Timnah lam ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mallam pang Ekron zul ah a paikhia a, Sikron ah a paisuak a, Baalah tang ah a pai zel a, Jabneel ah a pawt a; tuipi ah a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tumlam pang gamgi bel tuipi a zat a za leh a piau chiang teng ahi. Huai gam chiang ahi Judah suante adia a inkuan uh dungzui a sehsak a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jephunneh tapa Kaleb Toupa’n Joshua thu a piak bang in Judah suante lak ah tantuam a bawlsak a, huai bel Kiriath Arba ahi, Arba bel Anan pa ahi a, a khopi ahihleh Hebron ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaleb in huai khua apan Anak tapate thum Sesai, Ahiman leh Talmai a delh khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai apan Debir khua a mite a vadou a; a ma in Debir khaw min Kiriath Sepher ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaleb in, “Kuapeuh Kiriath Sepher vadou a, va lazou peuhmah ka tanu Aksah a zi din ka pe ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kaleb unau Kenaz tapa Othniel in a va lazou a; huchi in a tanu Aksah a zi din a neisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a kiang a va tun in, a pa gam ngen din a kuan a; a sabiltung apan a kum hi. Kaleb in a kiang ah, “Bang na deih a?” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman, “Hon vualzawl in. Simlam gam lah n’on peta ngal a. Tuinak neite leng hon petel lai in” a chi hi. Huchi in tuinak nei saknungte leh khangnungte a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai ahi Judah suante nam, a inkuan uh dungzui a a gouluah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Simlam a Edom gamgi zul a Judah suante a neih khopi hiaite ahi uh: Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinah, Dimonah leh Adadah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kadesh, Hazor leh Ithnan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziph, Telem, Bealoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor, Hadattah, Kerioth, Hezron (huai Hazor ahi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Shema, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar gaddah, Hesmon, Beth palet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar shual, Beer–sheba, Bizjothjah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Baalah, Ijim, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Kesil, Hormah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziklag, Madmannah, leh Sansannah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain leh Rimmon ahi ua; Khopi tengteng sawmnih leh kua ahi a, a khopelte uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Phai gam lam ah Estaol, Zoreah, Asnah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Sokoh, Azekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sharaim, Adithaim, Gederah leh Gederothaim ahi ua, khopi teng sawmlehli ahi ua, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenan, Hadasah, Migdal Gad;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilean, Mizpah leh Joktheel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakis, Bozkath, Eglon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabbon, Lahmas, Kitlish;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederoth, Bethdagon, Naamah, Kakedah. Khopi tengteng sawmlehguk ahi ua, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnah, Ether, Ahsan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jiphtah, Asnah, Nezib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilah, Akzib leh Maresah. Khopi tengteng kua ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron leh a khopite leh a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekron apan tuipi tanpha in Ashdod zul a om tengteng a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ashdod leh a khopite leh a khopelte: Gaza leh a khopite leh a khopelte; Aigupta lui leh tuipi za leh a gei chiang pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Singtang gam lam ah Samir, Jattir, Sokoh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Dannah leh Kirjath Sannah, huai bel Debir ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Estemoh, Anim leh Gosen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gosen, Holon leh Giloh; khopi tengteng sawmlehkhat ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Arab, Dumah, Esean,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Janum, Beth tappuah, Aphekah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtah leh Kiriath Arba, huai bel Hebron ahi, leh Zior; khopi tengteng kua ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maon, Karmel, Ziph, Juttah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibeah leh Timnah; khopi tengteng sawm ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Halhul, Beth Zur, Gedor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarath, Beth Anoth leh Eltekon; khopite tengteng guk ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kiriath-baal, huai bel Kiriath-jearim ahi, leh Rabah; khopi nih leh a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Gamdai a Beth-arabah, Middin, Sekaka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Chi khopi Nibshan leh En Gedi; khopi tengteng guk ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Jerusalem khua a teng Jebuste ahihleh Judah suante’n a delhkhe zoukei ua, tunitan in Jerusalem ah Judah suante leh Jebuste a teng khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joseph suante tantuam, Jeriko zawn apan gamdai kiang, suahlam pang Jeriko tuite ah a suak a, Jeriko apan singtang gam ah Bethel pha in a paitou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel apan Luz ah a suak a, Arkamite gamgi a Ataroth pha in a pai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tumlam pang ah Japhleti gamgi Bethhoron khangnung zaw gamgi, Gezer pha in a paisuk zel a; tupi ah a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in Joseph suante Manasseh leh Ephraim suante’n tantuam in a lata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A inkuan uh dungzui zel a Ephraim suante gamgi hiai ahi: Suahlam pang a tantuam uh gamgi Ataroth Addar ahi a, Beth-horon sak nungzaw a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mikmethath mal tumlam pang ah a suak a, suahlam pang ah Taanathsilo pha in a kihei nawn a, Janohah suahlam ah a pai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Janohah apan Ataroth ah, Naarah ah a paisuk a, Jeriko a tung a, Jordan ah a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah apan tumlam pang ah Kanah luita pha in a pai a; tuipi ah a suak hi. Huaite ahi Ephraim suante a inkuan uh dungzui a a tantuam uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh suante tantuam lak a Ephraim suante adia khopi a seh tuam sakte toh, a khopi tengteng leh a khopelte leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gezer a teng Kanante a delhkhe kei ua; Ephraimte lak ah Kanante tunitan in a omlai ua, a sikha un a om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh suante tantuam hiaite ahi. Manasseh Joseph tapa masa ahi a, Gilead pa, Manasseh tapa masa Makir galhat a hih ziak in Gilead leh Bashan gam a tang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manasseh suan dang tengteng ading in a inkuan uh dungzui in tantuam leng a om hi. Abiezer suante ading, Helek suante ading, Sekem suante ading, Hepher suante ading, leh Semidah suante ading. Huaite a inkuan uh dungzui zel a Joseph tapa Manasseh suan pasalte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh tapa Makir, huai tapa Gilead, huai tapa Hepher, huai tapa Zelophehad in tapa neilou in tanu ngen a nei hi. A tanute min Mahlai, Noah, Hoglai, Milkah leh Tirzah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siampu Eleazar ma ah leh Nun tapa Joshua ma ah leh miliante ma ah a hoh ua, “Ka unaute uh lak a tantuam hon pesam din Toupa’n Mosi thu a pia hi” chi’n a gen uh. Toupa thupiak bang in a pa uh unaute lak ah tantuam a pesamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan gal ah Gilead leh Bashan gam simlouh in, Manasseh tantuam ding in mun sawm a puk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Manasseh tanute’n a tapate uh lak ah tantuam a neihsam ziak uh ahi. Gilead gam bel Manasseh tapa dangte’n a tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasseh gamgi Sekem suahlam a om Asher apan Mikmethath pha in ahi a; taklam pang ah En Tappuah mite tenna pha in a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah gam Manasseh a ahi a; himahleh Manasseh gamgi chin a Tappuah ahihleh Ephraim suante a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamgi Kan in luita simlam pangah a paisuka, Ephraim suante gamgi a sun hi. Ephraim suante khopite khenkhat Manasseh suante khopite lak ah a om hi. Himahleh Manasseh suante gamgi bel Kana kuam mallam pang ah a pai a, tuipi ah a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simlam pang Ephraim a ahi a, mallam pang pen Manasseh a ahi. Tuipi a gamgi ahi. Mallam ah Asher pha in ahi a, suahlam ah Issakar pha in ahitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Issakar leh Asher gam ah Manasseh in Beth Sean leh a kim a khuate, Ibleam leh a kim a khuate, Endor a tengte leh a kim a khuate Taanak a tengte leh a kim a khuate, Meggiddo a tengte leh a kim a khuate zou in, khaw seh thum a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Manasseh suante’n huai khopi a tengte a delhkhe zou kei ua; Kanan mite huai gam ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Israel suante a honghat hiaihiai un, Kanante nasem a goih din a omsak ua, a delhkhe siangvek kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joseph suante’n Joshua kiang ah, “Bangchidan ahia gouluah ding tantuam seh khat, tan khat kia n’on piak tuam, Toupa’n lah tutan in a hon nak vualzawl mahmah ngal a?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joshua in a kiang uah, “Tam na hih uleh, Perizte leh miliante gammang na tenna ding un vavat un. Ephraim tang gam pen nou adia a neu luat leh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph suante’n, “Tanggam kou adin a hun kei hi. Phaigam a teng Kanan tengteng, Beth shean leh a khopi a tengte leh Jezreel guam a tengte’n sik kangtalai a neichiat tuamse uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joshua in Joseph inkuante, Ephraim leh Manasseh suante kiang ah, “Na tam mahmah ua, hat leng na hat ua; tan khat kia na neikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Tanggam teng nou ading ahilai ding hi. Gammang hita leh, na vat ding ua, a gam chiang tengteng nou a ahi ding’. Kanante’n sik kangtalaite nei in, hat tawk le uh leng, na hawlkhe zou ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai nung in Israel suan mipi tengteng Shiloh khua ah a kikhawm ua, huai ah Kihoupihna puanin a kai uh. Huai gam teng a zoukhinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel suante lak ah a tantuam uh tang nailou nam sagih a omlai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua in Israel suante kiang ah, “ Toupa na pipute uh Pathian in nou a hon piaksa gam, bang tan ahia luahlou a na awltat lai ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Namchih a mi thum zel telkhia unla; amau a kuan ding ua, gam a va en vialvial ding ua, a tantuam hun ding uh bangchiat zel in a vagelh ding ua; ka kiang ah a hongnawn ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mun sagihin a khenphot ding ua; Judah pawl simlam ah a tantuam uah a om ding ua, Joseph inkuante mallam ah a tantuam uah a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam mun sagih in va khen unla, huai gelhna honpia un. Huchi in hiai ah Toupa i Pathian ma ah ai k’on sansak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi teng in na lak uah tantuam a neikei ding uh. Toupa mai a siampu nasep amau goutan ahi. Gad pawl, Reuben pawl leh Manasseh nam kimkhat bel Jordan gal suahlam ah amau tantuam Toupa sikha Mosi in a piak a na tangta uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in huai mite a pawtkheta ua, Joshua in, “Gam va en vialvial unla, hon gelhkhia unla, ka kiang ah hontun nawn unla, hiai ah Shiloh khua ah Toupa ma ah ai k’on sansak ding” chi in thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite a kuan ua, gam a va en vialvial ua, mun sagih in a khen ua, laibu ah a khuakhua in a gelhkhia ua, giahphual Shiloh ah Joshua kiang ah a kiknawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua in Shiloh ah Toupa ma ah ai a na sansak a; huai ah Joshua in Israel suante a kikhen dan bangzel un gam a hawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aisan a inkuan uh dungzui in Benjamin suante tung ah a keta a; a gamgi chiang uh Judah suante leh Joseph suante kikal ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mallam pang a a gamgi chiang uh Jordan apan ahi a; Jeriko sik ah mallam pang ah a paitou a, tumlam pang ah tanggam ah a paitou zel a; Beth-Aven gamdai ah a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai apan Luz lam ah, Luz, huai bel Bethel ahi, sik ah, simlam pang ah a pai zel a; Beth-horon khang simlam pang a tangzul ah Ataroth-adar ah a paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pai zel a, Beth-horon simlam pang a tangchin apan tumlam ah simlam pang ah a kualphei a; Kiriath-baal, huai Kiriath-jearim ahi, Judah suante khopi ah a tawp a; huai tumlam pang gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simlam pang a gam Kiriath-jearim tawp apan ahi a; tumlam ah a pawt a, Nephtoah lui tuite ah a pai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rephaim mallam pang guam a Hinnomtapa guam chin a tangmong ah a paisuk a; Jebuste sik ah, simlam pang a Hinnom guam ah a paisuk a, En-rogel ah a paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mallam zuan in a pai a, En-semes ah a pai a, Adumim kahtouhna chin Geliloth ah a pai a; Reuben tapa Bohan suang ah a paisuk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arabah sik mallam pang ah a pai zel a, Arabah ah a paisuk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Beth-hoglah sik, mallam pang ah a pai zel a; a tawpna bel Jordan simtawp, Chi Tuipi mallam tuipi meng ah ahi. Huai simlam gamgi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan suahlam pang, a gamgi chiang ahi. Huai ahi Benjamin suante a inkuan uh dungzui a a tantuam gam in a kolhkhum sung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin suante a inkuan dungzui un a khopite uh, Jeriko, Beth-hoglah, Emek keziz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth-arabah, Zemariam, Bethel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avim, Parah, Ophrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kephar-ha-ammonai, Ophni leh Geba; a khopi tengteng sawmlehnih ahi a, a khopel tengteng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpeh, Kephirah, Mozah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zelah, Eleph, Jebus, huai Jerusalem ahi, leh Gibeah leh Kiriath, khopi sawmlehli, a khopelte toh. Hiaite ahi Benjamin suante a inkuan uh dungzui ua a tantuam ding ua seh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aisan nihveina Simeon suante tung ah a inkuan uh dungzui in a puk hi. A tantuam uh Judah suante tantuam lak ah a tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tantuam ding ua pukte Beer–sheba, Sheba, Moladah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Balah, Ezem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziklag, Beth-markaboth, Hazar susah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-lebaoth leh Sharuhen; khopi tengteng sawmlehthum ahi a, khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ain, Rimmon, Ether leh Ashan: khopi li, a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai khopi kim a khopel tengteng Baalath Beer simlam a Ramah a pha hi. Huaite Simeon suante a inkuan uh dungzui a amau tantuam dia seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeon suante tantuam Judah suante tantuam lak a ahi. Judah suante tantuam amau adin a zalaw ngal a; huaiziak in Simeon suante tantuam lak ah a tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aisan thumveina Zebulun suante tung ah a inkuan uh dungzui in a puk hi. A tantuam gamgi uh Sarid tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A gamgi uh tumlam pang ah Maralah pha in a pai a, Dabeseth a va tung a; Jokneam kiang a luita a va tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sarid apan suahlam pang ni suahna lam ah Kisloth-tabor gamgi pha in a kawitou a; Daberath ah a pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai apan suahlam pang ah Gittah-hepher leh Etah-kazin ah a pai zel a, Neah lam zuan in Rimmon ah a pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mallam ah Hanathon ah a kualphei nawn a, a pawtna Iphtah El guam ah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Katath, Nahalal, Shimron, Idalah leh Bethlehem; khopi tengteng sawmlehnih ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiaite ahi Zebulun suante a inkuan uh dungzui a, a tantuam ding ua seh; huai khopite leh khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aisan liveina Issakar suante tung ah a inkuan uh omdan dungzui in a puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gamgi chiang uh Jezreel, Kesuloth, Shunem,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Haphraim, Shion, Anaharath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabbith, Kishion, Abez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah leh Beth-pazzez tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tabor, Shahazimah leh Beth-shemesh a va pha a; a pawtna Jordan ah ahi a, khopi tengteng sawmlehguk ahi a, a khopel teng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hiaite ahi Issakar suante nam a inkuan uh dungzui a, a tantuam ding ua seh; khopite leh a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aisan ngana Asher suante tung ah a inkuan uh dungzui in a puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gamgi chiang Helkath, Hali, Beten, Aksaph,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Allammelek, Amad leh Mishal ahi a; tumlam pang ah Karmel tang leh Sihor-libnath a phasuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni suahna lampang ah Beth-dagon a kualtou a, Zebulun leh mallam pang ah Jiphthah-el guam ah Beth-emek leh Neiel a vapha a; veilam ah Kabul pha in a pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebron leh Rehob, Hammon leh Kanah, Zidon thupi pha in a pai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gamgi Ramah leh Tura khopi kulhnei ah a kualphei a, Hosah ah a kualphei nawn a, Akzib gam tuipi ah a pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ummah, Aphek leh Rehob; khopi tengteng sawmnih leh nih ahi a, a khopel teng toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huaite ahi Asher suante nam a inkuan uh dungzui a, a tantuam uh; khopite leh a khopelte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aisan gukna Naphtali suante tung ah a inkuan uh dungzui in a puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A gamgi chiang uh Heleph leh Za-ananim a singkung lianpi apan Adami Nekeb, Jabneel leh Lakkum pha in a pai a, Jordan ah a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tumlam pang ah Aznoth-tabor ah a paisuk in; huai apan Hukok ah a pai a, simlam ah Zebulun a vatung a, tumlam ah Asher a tung a, ni suahna lam ah Judia gam a Jordan a phatou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khopi kulhbang neite: Ziddim, Zer, Hamath, Rakkath, Kinneret,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamah, Ramah, Hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedesh, Edre-i, En-hazor,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Iron, Migdal-el, Horem, Beth-anath leh Beth-shemesh ahi a, khopi tengteng sawm ahi a, a khopel teng uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hiaite ahi Naphtali suante nam a inkuan dungzui ua a tantuam uh, khopite leh a khopelte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aisan sagihna Dan suante tung ah a inkuan uh dungzui in a puk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A tantuam gamgi uh Zoreah, Estaol leh Ir-shemes,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Sha-alabin, Aijalon leh Jethlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Timnah, Ekron,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimmon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Me-jarkon, Rakkon leh Jopah kiang a gamgi toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Dan suante gamgi in huaite a vakheng a; Dan suante’n Lesem a dou ua, a la ua, namsau in a hihmang ua, a tangta uh. Huai ah a teng pah ua, a pu uh Dan mintam in Lesem, Dan a na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hiaite ahi Dan suante nam a inkuan uh dungzui a, a tantuam uh; huai khopi leh a khopelte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huchi in a tantuam ding ua gamgi bawl bangzel a gam a hawmkhit un, Israel suante’n Nun tapa Joshua a lak uah tantuam a bawlsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Toupa thupiak bang in Ephraim singtang gam a, a khopi din a nget mah Timnath Serah a pia ua; aman khopi a sat a, huai ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hiaite ahi siampu Eleazar, Nun tapa Joshua leh Israel suante nam inkuan a intekpente’n Shiloh a Toupa ma a Kihoupihna puanin kongkhak a aisan a, a goutan ding ua a na hawmte uh. Huchi in gam kihawm a zouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n Joshua a houpih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel suante kiang ah, ‘Kihumbitna khuate bawl in, Mosi zang a na kiang ua ka genkhitsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kuapeuh theilou leh tumlou pi a mithat kha, huai ah a tailut thei ding hi. Huchi in sisan phulami apan nou adin kihumbitna ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai khopite lak a a koi hiam pen a, a tailut chiang in, khopi kulh kongpi lutna ah a va ding dia, huai khaw upate bil a zak in a tanchin a vatun ding. Amau khopi sung ah a kiang uah a pilut ding ua, a lak ua a ten sam theihna din a omna ding a sehsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sisan phulami in a hondelh leh a thatmi pen a khut ah na pe ding uh ahi kei. A invengte theilou a, a thah ahi a, a ma in a haw ngalkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipi ma a vaihawmsak dia adin ma leh siampu lian a pangpa a sih mateng, huai khopi ah a teng ding hi. Huai nung in mi thatmi pen amah khaw sung mahmah, a tai khiaksan khua, amah mah inn sung ah a lut nawn ding ahi’ ” chi’n gen in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Naphtali tanggam a Galili a Kadesh, Ephraim tanggam a Sekem leh Judia singtang gam a Kirath Arba, huai bel Hebron ahi, a septa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suahlam ah Jordan gal a Jeriko ah Reuben nam gam a gamdai phaizang a Bezer, Gad nam gam a Gilead gam a Ramoth, Manasseh nam gam a Bashan a Golan a septa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai khuate ahi Israel suan tengteng leh a lak ua namdang tengte adia seh a om. Kuapeuh mi that kha, hiai khuate a tailut in mipi mai a adin mateng sisan phulami khut ah silou in a omthei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Levi chi inkuan a intekpente siampu Eleazar kiang ah leh Nun tapa Joshua kiang ah leh Israel suante nam inkuan a intekpente kiang ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kanan gam a Shiloh khua ah, Toupa’n Mosi zang in ka tenna ding uh khopite, ka gan uh tatna ding a kimvel toh n’on piak ding uh thu a na peta” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Israel suante’n Toupa thupiak bang in a tantuam ua kipan hiai khopite a kimvel toh Levi chite a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aisan Kohath suan tung ah a pukta hi. Huchi in siampu Aron suan Levi chi a mite’n Judah nam tantuam apan, Simeon nam tantuam apan leh Benjamin nam tantuam apan khopi sawmlehthum aisan in a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohath suan dangte’n Ephraim nam suante tantuam apan, Dan nam tantuam apan leh Manasseh nam kimkhat tantuam apan khopi sawm aisan in a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gershon suante’n Issakar nam suante tantuam apan, Asher nam tantuam apan, Naphtali nam tantuam apan leh Bashan gam a Manasseh nam kimkhatte tantuam apan, khopi sawmlehthum aisan in a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merari suante’n a inkuan uh dungzui in Reuben nam tantuam apan, Gad nam tantuam apan leh Zebulun nam tantuam apan khopi sawmlehnih a tangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel suante’n Toupa’n Mosi zang a thu a piak bang in Levi mite khopite leh a kimvel aisan in a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Judah suante nam tantuam apan leh Simeon suante nam tantuam apan hiai khopi minlohte a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaite Levi suan, Kohath pawl a namte, Aron suan pawl ading ahi; aisan amau tung ah a puk masapen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau adin Judah tanggam a Kiriath Arba leh a kim a gantatna gam toh a pia uhi. Kiriath Arba Hebron kichi ahi a, Arba ahihleh Anak pa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khopi kimvelte leh a khopelte Jephunneh tapa Kaleb tantuam din a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siampu Aron suante Hebron, mi thatmite kihumbitna khopi, a kimvel toh, Libnah khua, a kimvel toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jattir khua, a kim a velte toh, Astemoa khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon khua, a kim a velte toh, Debir khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain khua, a kim a velte toh, Juttah khua, a kim a velte toh; Beth Semes khua, a kim a velte toh; huai nam nihte tantuam apan khopi kua a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin nam tantuam apan Gibeon khua, a kim a velte toh, Geba khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathoth khua, a kim a velte toh, Almon khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi li a pelai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aron suan, siampute khopi tengteng khopi sawmlehthum ahi, a kim a velte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kohath suante inkuan, Levi pawl leh Kohath suan dangte’n leng a tantuam khopite uh Ephraim nam tantuam apan in ahi a tan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi thatmite kihumbitna khopi Ephraim singtang gam a Sekem khua, a kim a velte toh, Gezer khua a kim a velte toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibzaim khua, a kim a velte toh, Bethhoron khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi li a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan nam tantuam apan Eltekeh khua, a kim a velte toh, Gibbethon khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon khua, a kim a velte toh, Gath-rimmon khua, a kim a velte toh, khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Manasseh nam kimkhatte tantuam apan Taanak khua, a kim a velte toh; Gath-rimmon khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohath suan dangte nam khopi tengteng khaw sawm ahi, a kim a velte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gershon suante pawl, Levi namte Manasseh nam kimkhatte tantuam apan, mi thatmite kihumbitna khopi, Bashan gam a Golan khua, a kim a velte toh; Beeshterah khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi nih a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Issakar nam tantuam apan Kishion khua, a kim a velte toh, Daberath khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmuth khua, a kim a velte toh, En-gannim khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher nam tantuam apan Mishal khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkath khua, a kim a velte toh, Rehob khua, a kim a velte toh, khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Naphtali nam tantuam apan, mi thatmite kihumbitna khopi, Galili gam a Kadesh khua, a kim a velte toh, Hammoth Dor khua, a kim a velte toh, Kartan khua, a kim a velte toh, khopi thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gershon pawl a inkuan uh dungzui zel a, a tantuam uh khopi tengteng sawmlehthum ahi, a kim a velte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Merari suante pawl inkuan, Levi pawl dangte bel Zebulun nam tantuam apan Jokneam khua, a kim a velte toh, Karta khua, a kim a velte toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnah khua, a kim a velte toh, Nahalal khua, a kim a velte toh, khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Reuben nam tantuam apan Bezer khua, a kim a velte toh, Jahaz khua, a kim a velte toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemoth khua, a kim a velte toh; khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Gad nam tantuam apan, mi thatmite kihumbitna khopi, Gilead gam a Ramoth khua, kim a velte toh, Mahanaim khua, a kim a velte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Heshbon khua, a kim a velte toh, Jazer khua, a kim a velte toh; avek in khopi li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hiai tengteng Levi pawl inkuan dangte Merari suante pawl a inkuan uh dungzui zel a, a khopite uh ahi. Huchi in a tantuam uh khopi sawmlehnih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel suante pawl tantuam apan Levi pawl khopi tengteng sawmli leh giat ahi, a kim a velte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hiai khopite’n a kimvel a neichiat ua; khopi tengteng huchibang vek ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n a pipute uh kichiam a piak a na chiamsa gam tengteng Israelte a pia hi. Amau huai gam a luah ua, asung ah a tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Toupa’n a pipute uh kiang a kichiam a, a na chiamsa bang ngei in munchih ah muanna a pia a, a melma tengteng uh kuamah a ma ua pangzou himhim a omkei uhi. Toupa’n a melma tengteng a khut uah a pevek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Toupa’n Israel inkuante kiang a, a hoih lam thu a na gen tengteng vuaksuak khat leng a omkei a, a hongtung vek hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in Joshua in Reuben pawlte, Gad pawlte leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte a sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiang uah, “ Toupa sikha Mosi in hon thupiak peuhmah na zuita ua, ken thu k’on piak peuhmah leng na zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuni pha in na unaute uh na taisan kei ua, Toupa na Pathian un hihdia thu a honpiak na zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a kiang ua a na gensa bang in, na unaute uh muanna a peta hi. Huaiziak in, Toupa sikha Mosi in Jordan gal a na tantuam ding ua a hon piaksa gam ah, na puanin kaihte uah pai nawnta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa sikha Mosi in Toupa na Pathian uh it a, a lampi tengteng tawn a, a thupiakte zui a, amah len chinten a, na lungtang tengteng uleh na kha tengteng ua amah na sem chiatchiat dia a hon thupiakte, huai thupiak leh dante pilvangtak in limsak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in amau a vualzawl a, a paisakta hi. Huchi in a puanin lam uah a paita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasseh nam kimkhatte Mosi in Bashan gam ah tantuam a pia a; a kimkhat dangte Joshua in tumlam pang ah Jordan gal ah a unaute lak ah tantuam a pezawta hi. Joshua in a inlam ua a paisakdek lai in a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Na puanin lam uah hauhsakna tamtak toh paita unla, gan tampi toh, dangka toh, dangkaeng toh, dal toh, sik toh, silhlehten tampi toh. Na melmate ua pan na gallakte uh unaute toh kihawm dialdial un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte a kiknawn ua, Kanan gam Shiloh khua apan Israel suante kiang apan Gilead gam, Toupa’n Mosi zang a thu a na piak bang in amau tantuam ding mawng a sehsa gam a pai din a pawtkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kanan gam a Jordan gamgi a va tun un Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte’n Jordan lui gei ah maitam lianpi kholang mahmah khat a doh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte’n Kanan gamchin tak, Jordan gamgi, Israel suante gam lampang ah maitam a doh uh, chih Israelte kiang ah kuahiam khat in a va hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel suante’n hiai thu a zak un, Israel suan mipi tengteng amaute dou tum in Shiloh khua ah a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel suante’n Gilead gam a Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kiang ah siampu Eleazar tapa Phinehas a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Milian sawm, Israel nam a inkuan a intekpente in Phinehas a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte kiang Gilead gam ah a hoh ua, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa mite tengteng in, “Bangziak a tuni a Toupa tung a heltum a maitam doh a, Toupa lehngatsan na hi ua”? a chi uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peor mun a tatsiatnate, ei adia neu lua a sim theih ahi maw? Tunitan in leng huai a i khelhna ua pan silsiang i hi naikei ua, Toupa mipite lak ah hipi leng napi in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni a Toupa lehngatsan na tup maizen uh? Huchi in tuni’n Toupa tung ah na na helta maimah ua, zingchiang a zaw Israel mipi tengteng tung a Amah heh ding eive.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na gam luah uh sianglou ahihleh, Toupa gam, Toupa biakbuk omna mun ah hongpai unla, ka lak uah hongteng un. Himahleh Toupa i Pathian un a chihlouh maitam dang bawl in Toupa tung ah hel kei unla, kou tung ah leng hel kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zer tapa Akan in hamsiat thil ah a na hihkhial a, Israel mipi tengteng tung ah hehna a hongom ahi kei maw? Huai mi tatsiatna ah amah kia a mangthang tuam kei hi’ ” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Reuben suante, Gad suante leh Manasseh nam kimkhatte’n Israel nam a intekpente a dawng ua, a kiang uah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“ Toupa , pathiante Pathian, pathiante Toupa Pathian in a thei. Israel pawl in leng thei hen! Ka maitam doh uh Toupa lehngatsan a, hel tupna hiam thil hihkhelh tupna hiam a ka hih uleh, tuni in leng honhawi kei un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haltum thillatna ding hiam, nekding thillatna ding hiam, lemna thillatna ding hiam ahihleh, Toupa mahmah in thukhen hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Tunung chiang in na suante un ka suante uh kiang ah, Nou Toupa , Israelte Pathian na zat phakna uh bang om ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nou Reuben suante leh Gad suante aw, Toupa’n kou leh nou adin Jordan gamgi din a bawl hi. Toupa ah tantuam na neisam kei uh, a honchi kha ding uh, chi a, pilvan ziak a a ziak neitak a ka hih uh ahi. Na suante un kou suante Toupa laudan theilou in a bawl kha thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in, kisa un, maitam i bawl ding uh, haltum thillatna ding leh kithoihna ding bel hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kou leh, nou leh i nung ua i suante kikal ah theihpihna ahi dia, huchi in ka haltum thillatte uh leh ka kithoihnate uh leh ka lemna thillatte ua Toupa na ka sep theihna ding uh leh na suante un leng tunung chia ka suante uh kiang a Toupa ah tantuam na neisam kei uh, a honchih louhna ding un, ka chi ua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huaiziak in, hichi ahi ding a, tunung chiang a, ka kiang uh hiam, ka suante uh kiang uh hiam a huchibang a, a honchih chiang ua kou, En ve ua, ka pipute un Toupa maitam a bawl uh omdan, haltum thillatna ding leh kithoihna ding ahi kei a, kou leh nou kikal a theihpihna ahizaw hi, ka chihna ding ua, ka hih uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa tung a hel a Toupa lehngatsan a, Toupa ka Pathian uh maitam, a biakbuk chin a maitam kia lou haltum thillatna ding hiam, nekding thillatna ding hiam, theihpihna ding hiam a maitam bawl ka hih louh dan uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siampu Phinehas leh a kiang a om mipi milian, Israel pawl nam intekpente’n Reuben suante leh Gad suante leh Manasseh suan kimkhatte thugen a zak un a kipaksak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siampu Eleazar tapa Phinehas in Reuben suante leh Gad suante leh Manasseh suan kimkhatte kiang ah, Toupa tung a thil na hihkhelh louh ziak un, tun zaw Toupa i lak ua om ngeina ahi, chih ka thei tave ua. Huchi in Israel suante Toupa khut apan na honkheta uh, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchi in siampu Eleazar tapa Phinehas leh milian pawl, Reuben suante leh Gad suante apan leh Gilead gam apan Kanan gam ah Israel suante kiang ah a kiknawnta ua, thu a va tun nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huai thute’n Israel suante a kipaksak mahmah a; Israel suante’n Pathian a phatta uh. Huchi in Reuben suante leh Gad suante dou a, a tenna gam uh suksiat sak din kuankhiat a tum nawn kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Reuben suante leh Gad suante’n huai maitam pen ‘theihpihtu’ a chi uh. “ Toupa , Pathian a na hingei chih i kikal ua theihpihtu ahi ngal a” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Toupa’n Israelte a melma tengteng apan galmuanna a piak nung hun sautak a painungin Joshua a hong upa in, a hong tekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in Israel tengteng, a upate leh a intekpente, a vaihawmmite leh a heutu teng uh a samsaka, a kiang uah, “Ka upa in, ka tekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un noute ziak a hiai nam tengteng tung a a thilhihte na muta ua; Toupa na Pathian un, Amahmah in nou adin gal a hon dousak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, Jordan lui leh tumlam Tuipi Lian kikal a nam omlaite zou in, aisan in na tantuam ding un k’on pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un na ma uah amau a delhkhe dia, na muhbat louhna uah a hawlmang vek ding. Toupa na Pathian un na kiang ua a gensa bang in a gam uh na luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Mosi dan laibu a gelh tengteng taklam ah hiam veilam ah hiam a na pialsan hetlouhna ding un hangsantak in zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiai nam na lak ua omlaite toh tengkhawm kei un. A pathiante uh min gen kei unla, a minte un kichiam kei unla, a na uh leng sem kei unla, a ma uah leng kun in a na uh sem kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh tuni tan a na hih gige bang un, Toupa na Pathian uh lenkip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n na ma uah chi thupitak leh hattakte a delhkhe khinta hi. Na ma uah tunitan in kuamah pangzou himhim a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lak ua mi khat in mi sang khat a delh dia, na kiang ua a gensa bang in, Toupa na Pathian un nou adin gal a hondou sak ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian uh it ding in pilvang mahmah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilvang lou a, na lehngatsan himhim ua, hiai namte lak a omlaite, na lak ua omlaite ngei, na pawlmat ua, amaute toh pasal leh zi a na kineih ua, amaute na luppih ua, amau leng nou a hon luppih u le zaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un hiai namte na mitmuh un a hon delhkhiak sak nawn kei ding hi. Toupa na Pathian un hiai gam hoihtak a honpiak apan na manthat vek masiah uh amaute nou adin pial leh thang leh na pang ua din khetna chiang leh na mit ua din ling a honghi zaw ding uh, chih teltak in thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, tuni in lei pumpi dan bang in ka paita ding hi. Toupa na Pathian un na tungtang uh, a hoih lam, a na gensa tengteng vuaksuak khat lel leng a omkei, chih na lungtang tengteng uh leh na lungsim tengteng un na thei uhi. Na tung uah a hong tungvekta a, khat lel leng vuaksuak a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />huaiziak in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa na Pathian un thil hoih na kiang ua a gen tengteng na tung ua a hong tunvek tak mah bang in, Toupa na Pathian un a honpiak hiai gam hoih tak apan a hon manthat sak vek masiah Toupa’n thil hoihloute na tung uah a tung sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa na Pathian un a hon thupiak thukhun na tatlek san ua, pathian dangte nasem a kun a na biak uleh, Toupa hehna na tung uah a om dia, a honpiak gam hoih tak apan na mangthang pah ding uhi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Joshua in Israel nam tengteng Sekem ah a samkhawm a, Israel upate, a intekpente, a vaihawmmite leh a heutute uh a samsaka; Pathian ma ah a hong kimu sak chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua in mi tengteng kiang ah, “ Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi. Na pipute uh nidanglai in lui khen lam ah a teng ua, Abraham pa leh Nahor pa Terah hialte leng. Amaute’n pathian dangte nna a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na pu uh Abraham huai lui gal apan ka pikhia a, Kanan gam teng tawnsuak in ka pi a, a suante ka pungsak a, Isak ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isak kiang ah Jakob leh Esau ka pia a; Esau tantuam din Seir tang ka pia a; Jakob leh a tate Aigupta ah a paisuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron ka sawl a, a lak ua thillamdang hih in Aigupta ka gawt a: huaikhit in amau k’on pikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na pipute uh Aigupta gam apan ka pikhia a, tuipi na hongtung ua; Aigupta mite’n na pipute uh kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuang mite toh Tuipi San tan in a nungdelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau Toupa a sam ua, Aigupta mite toh na kikal uh a mialsak bikbek a, amaute tuipi tuamsak in a khuhkhum sak a; Aigupta gam a ka thilhih na mit un a mu a; gamdai ah sawtpi na teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jordan lui gal a om Amorte gam ah ka honpi a; amau a hondou uh. Na khut uah amau k’on pia a, a gam uh na luahta uh. Amau k’on hihmang sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab kumpipa Zippor tapa Balak a hong kisa a, Israel a dou a; Beor tapa Balaam nou hon hamsiat din a samsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Balaam thu ka ngaikhe kei hi. Huaiziak in nou a hon vualzawl zawsopta hi. Huchi in a khut apan k’on honkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jordan lui na kan ua, Jeriko khua na tung tou ua; Jeriko khomite’n a hon na dou ua, Amorte, Perizte, Kanante, Hitte, Girgaste, Hivte leh Jebuste toh; amau na khut uah k’on peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ma uah tunpi ka sawl a, huai in na ma uah amau a delh a, Amorte’ kumpipa nihte tan in leng. Himahleh na namsau un hiam, na thal un hiam in ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sepkhiak hetlouh uh gam leh na bawl hetlouh uh khopite k’on pia a, huaite ah na teng ua; na suanlouh uh grephuan leh olive huan apan na ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa laudan siam unla, chitak leh thutak in Amah na sem un. Na pipute un Luigal leh Aigupta gam a, a na a sep uh pathiante koih khia unla; Toupa na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa na sep hoihlou a na theih uh leh tuni in kua na ahia na sep ding uh, tel un. Na pipute un Luigal a, a na a sep uh pathiante hia, na luah uh gam a Amorte pathiante? Kei leh inkuante’n zaw Toupa na ahi ka sep ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipite’n, “ Toupa Pathian paisan a, pathian dangte na ka seplouh ding dan uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian ngei ahi, i pipute toh Aigupta gam saltanna inn apan hon pikhia a, i mitmuh a chiamtehna thupitak tak hih a, i paina teng leh mipi tengteng i nawk paisuakna ah leng hon vengbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n i ma ngei uah namchih huai gam a om Amorte ngei a delhkhe vek hi. Huaiziak in kou leng Toupa na ahi ka sep ding uh; Amah lah ka Pathian uh ahi ngal a” chi in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joshua in mipite kiang ah, “ Toupa nna nasem theikei ding uh. Amah lah Pathian siangthou ahi ngal a. Mullithat Pathian ahi a; na tatleknate uh leh na khelhnate uh a ngaidam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa na paisan ua, namdang pathiante nna nasep uleh, na tung ua thil hoih a hihkhit nung in a hong kihei dia, hon hihna in a honhih mangthang ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipite’n, Joshua kiang ah, “Hilou e, Toupa na ka sem kinken zaw ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua in mipite kiang ah, “A na sep tum in Toupa na telta uh, chih a theihpihtute noumau mah na hi uh” a chi hi. Amau, “Theihpihtute ka hi uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amahmah in, “Huchi ahihleh na lak ua namdang pathian omte koihmang unla, na lungtangte uh Toupa , Israelte Pathian lam ah awnsak un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipite’n Joshua kiang ah, “ Toupa i Pathian na ka sem ding ua, a thu ka zui ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huai ni’n Joshua in mipite toh kikal ah thu a khung a, Sekem khua ah dan leh vaihawmna a sehsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joshua in hiai thu Pathian Dan Laibu ah a gelh a; suang lianpi a la a, Toupa Mun Siangthou chin a tawsaw nuai ah a phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joshua in mipi tengteng kiang ah, “Ngai un, hiai suang i thu hon theihpihtu hi hen. Toupa’n i kiang ua thu a gen tengteng a zavekta hi. Huaiziak in na thu uh hon theihpihtu ahi ding hi, huchilou in zaw Pathian na kitheihmohbawl kha ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in Joshua in mipite a tantuam gamchiat uah a paisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, huai thilte khit in Nun tapa Joshua, Toupa sikha kum za leh sawm a upa a hih in a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gaash tang mallam pang, Ephraim tanggam a amah tantuam gamgi sung Timnath Serah ah a vuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joshua damsung leh amah khup a dam, Toupa’n Israelte adia thil a hih tengteng theihpih mite damsung in Israelte’n Toupa na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel suante’n Aigupta gam apan Joseph guhte a puak touh uh Sekem a Sekem pa Hamor tate apan Jakob in dangka za khat a a leina mun ah a vui ua; huai mun Joseph suante tantuam ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huan Aron tapa Eleazar a si a; Ephraim tang gam a a tantuam dia a piak a tapa Phinehas tang ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
